Meta.documentation:List.length
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Counts the elements of a flowing List.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Counts String, Number and Boolean elements between begin and end and emits
Meta.documentation:the count once the list ends.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:INTERIM: length is conceptually an output of List itself — see
Meta.documentation:docs/output-interfaces.md.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_$all — String element, counted
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — Number element, counted
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_$all — Boolean element, counted
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the element count, emitted at end of the list
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[String:a Number:2 Boolean:true]>>List.length:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:3
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see List.join String.length
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status interim
Meta.documentation:

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0Aconst%20Number%20%20%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FNumber%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20INTERIM%3A%20length%20is%20conceptually%20an%20output%20of%20List%20(see%20docs%2Foutput-interfaces.md)%0A%2F%2F%20implemented%20as%20an%20operator%20resource%20until%20named%20outputs%2Fpins%20land.%0A%2F%2F%20Counts%20the%20String%2FNumber%2FBoolean%20elements%20of%20a%20flowing%20list.%0Afunction%20length()%0A%7B%0A%20%20this.Number%20%3D%20new%20Number()%3B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22length%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DlengthProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20lengthProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%20%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_Number%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_begin%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09this.count%20%3D%200%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09function%20count_element()%20%7B%20this.count%2B%2B%3B%20%7D%20%2F%2F%20no%20arrow%20closures%20-%20cloning%20breaks%20them%0A%09this.in_String_%24all%20%3D%20count_element%3B%0A%09this.in_Number_%24all%20%3D%20count_element%3B%0A%09this.in_Boolean_%24all%20%3D%20count_element%3B%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09return%20this%3F.out_Number%3F.(%7Bvalue%3Aresource.Number.bigRat(this.count)%7D)%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Alength.Processor%3DlengthProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dlength%3B]>>NewResource:List.length
